cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Mini Pupper 4 backflip: sim to real"
abstract: >-
  Keyframe backflips for the Mini Pupper 4 quadruped (405 g, stock hobby servos): a MuJoCo simulator whose servo
  model is fitted to recorded flips, CMA-ES trajectory optimization robust over an ensemble of fitted models,
  real-robot telemetry and videos, and a dependency-free firmware keyframe player.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MangDang"
    website: "https://www.mangdang.net"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bariest/minipupper-backflip"
license: MIT
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
keywords:
  - quadruped
  - backflip
  - sim-to-real
  - MuJoCo
  - system identification
  - trajectory optimization
  - CMA-ES
  - Mini Pupper
